{"caption":"","data":"unsolved goals\nrelation : (Fin 9 → ℤ) → (Fin 9 → ℤ) → Prop\ndigits_to_num : (Fin 9 → ℤ) → ℤ\nhdigits_to_num : digits_to_num = fun dig => ∑ i, dig i * 10 ^ ↑i\nhrelation :\n  ∀ (d e : Fin 9 → ℤ),\n    relation d e ↔\n      (∀ (i : Fin 9), d i < 10 ∧ d i ≥ 0 ∧ e i < 10 ∧ e i ≥ 0) ∧\n        ∀ (i : Fin 9), 7 ∣ digits_to_num fun j => if j = i then e j else d j\nhdiff : ∀ (a b : Fin 9 → ℤ), digits_to_num b = digits_to_num a + ∑ j, (b j - a j) * 10 ^ ↑j\na b : Fin 9 → ℤ\ni : Fin 9\n⊢ ∑ j, ((if j = i then b j else a j) - a j) * 10 ^ ↑j = (b i - a i) * 10 ^ ↑i","endPos":{"column":33,"line":31},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/revalidation/P15/dd6ba7af833b86fafe8b48146ef37df84bf346626e1dccc4b2de202622c580b0-candidate/mathlib-v4.26.0/fresh/lean/002_saved_candidate/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"Tactic.unsolvedGoals","pos":{"column":64,"line":30},"severity":"error"}
